{
  "about": "Examples of which bucket a chest goes in. The web app (TypeScript) and the PC companion (C#) must both give the bucket shown for every example. Each example names one of the data files below and an instant in UTC. The bucket is '<week>|<period>': the week is the UTC date of the most recent weekly reset at or before the instant, and the period is the id of the Treasure Hour containing the instant (start included, end excluded), or 'normal'.",
